   146	`x` and `y` are nuisance base rates, constrained by `e <= a - k` per arm.
   147	Acceptance is registered as `a = 1` for every arm in these scenarios, so the
   148	all-assigned and accepted safety denominators coincide. A separate
   149	accepted-denominator boundary scenario uses `a = 0.95` in every arm with
   150	`e_subject = e_comparator + 0.0095`, which puts the accepted-denominator
